&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Account Manager to support market development and expand current accounts. This role will be concentrated on U.S. high schools. A key component of this role involves travel to your territory to thrive on the front lines (one of our company values) with customers, as in-person engagement is crucial for success. You will also drive sales via online demos and over the phone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a sales cycle.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll collaborate with athletic directors and coaches to ensure their schools and teams have what they need to develop and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close sales face-to-face with customers in your territory.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe being face-to-face with customers is a key differentiator for success. You will also utilize phone and online demos to continuously drive sales forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across multiple sports.&lt;/strong&gt; Whether it&#39;s volleyball or American football, you&#39;ll understand how all programs can benefit from video analysis. Understanding our customer personas regardless of sport is extremely important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we pair Account Managers (who focus on growing revenue) with Customer Success Managers (who focus on engagement, implementation and renewal revenue). This helps us ensure we&#39;re growing across all sports, product verticals and locations, in addition to supporting customers&#39; journeys with Hudl.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with other teammates in-office will be an integral part of your work. This role is open to candidates based in Lincoln or Omaha, NE and requires 3 days in the Lincoln office per week.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;. You have at least two years of business-to-business sales experience and have a consistent track record of achieving/exceeding goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motivation&lt;/strong&gt;. You love to beat your own records, expect the best from yourself, and always want to keep improving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational skills. &lt;/strong&gt;You own your territory by mapping out your days with the prospects you&#39;re going to contact, and you&#39;re comfortable working in a remote environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS experience&lt;/strong&gt;. If you&#39;ve spent time selling software-as-a-service, that&#39;s a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledgeable about sports&lt;/strong&gt;. Being an athlete, coach or administrator in club or high school sports isn&#39;t necessary but would help you connect with our user base.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prior Salesforce usage&lt;/strong&gt;. We use it for our CRM software, but don&#39;t worry if you&#39;re not familiar with it yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re always investing in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of your mental and physical health.&lt;/strong&gt; Medical plans tailored for you and your family—including vision, dental, and fertility benefits—and stay supported with our EAP and Employee Resource Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K).&lt;/strong&gt; Yep, that&#39;s free money. We&#39;ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range and on-target earnings (OTE) for this role are displayed below. &lt;strong&gt;Typically, the total compensation will fall within the middle of the OTE band.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation decisions are based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final compensation will depend on your performance against quotas outlined in your Individual Sales Plan (ISP) upon hire.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$40,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$50,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On-Target Earnings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
