&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Customer Success Manager on a temporary contract until the end of May 2027. The Customer Success Manager will manage a portfolio of Enterprise Business clients adjacent to the sports industry including but not limited to media companies, brands, consultancies and analytics firms within a designated territory, with the aim to ensure organizations get the maximum benefit and higher ROI out of their subscription, ultimately ensuring they adopt, consume and renew / expand across additional data solutions such as varying API products. In this role, you’ll:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop strong customer relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll maximize satisfaction across a group of accounts and become a trusted partner for your customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be involved in all aspects of support and account management&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll demonstrate the products, educate customers, and carry out a range of engagement and commercial activities associated with a CSM position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work toward goals&lt;/strong&gt;. Throughout the year, CSMs aim to achieve quarterly and yearly renewal targets. You’ll run business reviews, kick off call meetings to understand client adoption and consumption levels and identify opportunities for upselling additional services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;. On site-visits or events when necessary to accommodate client needs and sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a temporary contract covering a parental leave, expected to run until the end of May 2027.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of our Barcelona Office and you&#39;ll be expected to work from the office 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; Presentation skills are key in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical&lt;/strong&gt;. You’re comfortable looking through adoption data / metrics that showcase user behavior and engagement and know how to drive further uptake / adoption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology savvy&lt;/strong&gt;: we don’t expect you to build an API but to understand customer problems and how our data / video solutions can help.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive&lt;/strong&gt;. You have high activity levels and are on top of reaching out to clients, and you love going the extra mile to help a customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathetic.&lt;/strong&gt; You can step into the customer’s world, understanding their problems to provide better solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organized. &lt;/strong&gt;You have workflows and processes that help prioritize what’s most important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delegator.&lt;/strong&gt; You know what to take on yourself and what can be sent off to other areas within Hudl to best serve your customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background as a CSM.&lt;/strong&gt; Ideally you have a background in a sports /&amp;nbsp; tech company working as a CSM that lives and breathes adoption / consumption / retention and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sports technology savvy&lt;/strong&gt;. If you already understand our products and are able to effectively communicate their value to clients, that’s a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a can-do attitude and “think in solutions” not problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Previous sales experience. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ve walked the walk and used to working with sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual&lt;/strong&gt;. English is a must (any other languages are a plus).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&amp;nbsp; Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you’re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range and on-target earnings (OTE) for this role are displayed below. &lt;strong&gt;Typically, the total compensation will fall within the middle of the OTE band.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation decisions are based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final compensation will depend on your performance against quotas outlined in your Individual Sales Plan (ISP) upon hire.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€27.825&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€46.375 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On-Target Earnings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€39.750&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€66.250 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a team of engineers focused on our Fan and Club products. You&#39;ll lead the teams that power millions of tickets sold, millions of livestreaming hours, and Club sports programs and high school athletic departments nationwide. This role requires a high level of strategic thinking, technical leadership, and management expertise to drive our mission forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; at Hudl, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Team-Level Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and drive the strategy for your teams, ensuring alignment with Hudl&#39;s overall vision. Your strategic insights will help set the direction for multiple teams and ensure we stay ahead in the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and Develop Engineers:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a high performance, team-oriented culture by leading and mentoring engineers ranging from senior to new-to-career. You&#39;ll be responsible for developing leadership capabilities, promoting best practices, and ensuring high performance across your teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Across Disciplines:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with leaders from various disciplines to plan and deliver enhancements across your product suite. Your ability to integrate diverse perspectives will be key to driving innovation and ensuring our products meet the highest standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technical Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a technical leader, guiding your teams in the development of robust, scalable solutions on the cloud. Your deep technical knowledge will be crucial in solving complex challenges and driving engineering excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Agentic/AI Engineering Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive acceleration of our software development lifecycle via impactful adoption of AI development tooling and patterns. We&#39;re investing heavily in the best tools available to dramatically increase how quickly we&#39;re able to get our products in the hands of customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While local candidates in Lincoln, Nebraska are prioritized, we&#39;re open to remote applicants who reside in one of the following states: Alabama, Arizona, Florida, Georgia, Idaho, Illinois, Indiana, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Louisiana, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, New Hampshire, North Carolina, Nevada, Ohio, Oklahoma, Pennsylvania, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Virginia, Wisconsin, Wyoming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have extensive experience in cloud technology and building highly scalable software solutions.&lt;/strong&gt; You should have a proven track record of designing, implementing, and maintaining cloud-based systems that can scale efficiently and handle millions of livestreams and ticket sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrate a track record of driving technical strategy and leading engineering efforts.&lt;/strong&gt; You will have experience in setting technical direction for product areas like our Fan and Club groups and guiding your teams towards successful project outcomes, ensuring alignment with the company&#39;s strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Possess strong managerial experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You must have a background in leading engineering teams, with skills in career coaching and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrate an AI-forward mindset and strong bias for agentic engineering techniques.&lt;/strong&gt; Hudl has been aggressively adopting AI coding tools and expects our engineering leaders to drive impactful and efficient adoption across their team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven communication skills and ability to work collaboratively across disciplines and teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Your ability to articulate ideas clearly and work effectively with various stakeholders will be crucial - you will partner with Product Management and Design to ship the future of our Fan experience and Club tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in product partnership.&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to partner effectively with Product Managers to shape and solidify the team&#39;s roadmap is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive work environment.&lt;/strong&gt; You will champion diversity and inclusion within your teams, creating a workplace where all team members feel valued and empowered to contribute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video processing and storage experience.&lt;/strong&gt; If you&#39;ve used tools like ffmpeg, or video livestreaming protocols like HLS, RTMP, SRT or similar, that&#39;s a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction processing and financial systems experience.&lt;/strong&gt; We use Stripe to process transactions, Stripe Connect to power user payout and operate a financial ledger to track transactions. Experience working with end-user financial systems is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional background in TypeScript, React, GraphQL, C#, MongoDB, and AWS.&lt;/strong&gt; Adjacent languages, frameworks and services used at scale are also relevant experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile development know-how.&lt;/strong&gt; Hudl is heavily invested in React Native to bring our Fan experience to iOS, Android, and a variety of CTV platforms with a single codebase, so experience with React Native or mobile development (native iOS or Android) would be an asset in this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with hybrid teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Our engineering team is spread across the U.S. with people working both in office and remotely. If you&#39;ve worked with hybrid or remote teams before, that would help you adapt more quickly to Hudl&#39;s working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re always investing in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of your mental and physical health.&lt;/strong&gt; Medical plans tailored for you and your family—including vision, dental, and fertility benefits—and stay supported with our EAP and Employee Resource Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K).&lt;/strong&gt; Yep, that&#39;s free money. We&#39;ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring an Engineering Manager to join our Applied Machine Learning team to lead our squads across American football and ice hockey. You’ll drive game-changing initiatives using computer vision and deep learning at scale to automatically generate game data, event detection and player tracking - delivering critical, real-time insights directly to coaches during games as well as powering post-game analysis products. Our systems process thousands of games in parallel during peak hours, using models grounded in recent research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver for customers and manage teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Directly manage members across two established squads, helping them meet quarterly commitments, resolve unknowns and engage stakeholders to prioritise high-impact deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical and modeling excellence.&lt;/strong&gt; Set high standards across both engineering and data science, balancing model precision with execution speed and cost-effectiveness in cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve complex real-world challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead your team to maintain model accuracy across diverse, real-world camera footage and environmental conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with product stakeholders, cross-functional partners and leaders to align roadmap priorities and resolve dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate an empowered environment.&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a high-performing, supportive environment that enables your squads to operate at their highest potential and grow professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We’re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London. You’ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team. We&#39;re also open to remote candidates in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proven leader.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience managing teams of individual contributors, including engineers and data scientists, and you love helping teammates grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production AI/ML and computer vision experience. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ve built and deployed machine learning systems and computer vision models at scale in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balanced between engineering and modeling&lt;/strong&gt;. You can push data science modeling forward while building scalable software, keeping a sharp eye on system efficiency, speed and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong communicator. &lt;/strong&gt;You easily break down complex technical trade-offs for anyone across the company and naturally build strong relationships with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sports tech background. &lt;/strong&gt;You have experience applying AI, machine learning or computer vision to sports performance or analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-time systems experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve built or fine-tuned real-time data processing pipelines or high-volume parallel cloud workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
