&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A current student.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re excited for the opportunity to work with our partnerships team because it’ll complement and enhance your education and give you a leg up when you take your next steps after school.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skillful and deliberate. &lt;/strong&gt;You know your way around telling stories, communicating to audiences and how you can generate demand around products and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team-oriented.&lt;/strong&gt; You can build relationships across departments through hard work, trust and being respectfully blunt while being able to take respectful critique because you know your work will be better because of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible.&lt;/strong&gt; You take ownership in your work to hit deadlines, meet expectations and raise red flags when you see them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-versed.&lt;/strong&gt; You know - or are willing to learn - definition of nurture or lead, the difference between inbound and outbound and the best way to keep our customers coming back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident. &lt;/strong&gt;You know how and when to push back on the details that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech savvy.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a basic understanding of Excel/Google Sheets, and CRM tools like Salesforce.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced.&lt;/strong&gt; Previous roles in partnerships, sales, customer success or business development would be a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicator. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re confident in presenting yourself in both written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;HowtoWriteaJobAdvert/JobAdvertisement-YouAre(heading2,bolded)&quot;&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ask you to make an impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; You&#39;re part of the team—that means you&#39;ll have real responsibilities. We want to hear what you think and see what you can do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But even if you’re taking advantage of the opportunity to work remotely, we’ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop your career.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; On top of working alongside some of the best professionals in the business and gaining real-world experience, we’ll give you extra opportunities like lunch-and-learns and access to curated libraries to round out your internship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You’ll have an entire team on your side to give advice and provide answers to your questions, plus more resources like topic-specific Slack channels and employee resource groups. In short, we have you covered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The hourly pay range for this role is set by a candidate’s year in school, and will be determined by their academic standing at the start of the internship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Hourly Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$15.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hudl builds category-defining products for teams, coaches, and athletes. We’re hiring a Product Manager to join our team, focused on leading discovery and delivery for key product initiatives in the club ice hockey market. This role is focused on our suite of products that enable an athlete&#39;s journey––registration to a signed NLI. You&#39;ll work on our products that span from recruitment tools to video analysis, while directly contributing toward Hudl’s purpose of giving every athlete the shot they deserve. You’ll also help us expand our impact on club operations as we scale into this market.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Product Manager, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead product squads. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll act as the product owner for a cross-functional squad, keeping the backlog transparent and prioritized while collaborating with design and engineering to deliver on-strategy outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a connected ecosystem for ice hockey.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll be responsible for creating a strategy to deliver value by bringing multiple Hudl offerings together in a way that works for your market. You’re the captain on the ice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive discovery and delivery. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll lead discovery for projects to reduce risks around value and usability, and then work with a release team to ensure those solutions successfully hit the market with measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape product strategy. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll evaluate opportunities based on customer value, business viability, and long-term platform strategy while helping define the roadmap for your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design AI-powered workflows. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll use AI tools and product thinking to automate manual work, reduce operational friction, and help customers operate by exception instead of constant intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect the business.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll build strong context across customer success, sales, partnerships, legal, finance, and support to ensure solutions work for the broader business and ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While local candidates in Lincoln and Omaha, Nebraska are prioritized, we’re open to remote applicants who reside in one of the following states: Alabama, Arizona, Florida, Georgia, Idaho, Illinois, Indiana, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Louisiana, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, New Hampshire, North Carolina, Nevada, Ohio, Oklahoma, Pennsylvania, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Virginia, Wisconsin and Wyoming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced product leader.&lt;/strong&gt; You have 3–6 years of experience as a Product Manager with a track record of driving complex initiatives from discovery through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User and domain expert. &lt;/strong&gt;You bring a deep understanding of customer needs and competitive trends, using qualitative and quantitative data to solve core problems up front.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A collaborative communicator. &lt;/strong&gt;You build trust with cross-functional teams and stakeholders, using logic and clarity to inspire action without relying on direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business savvy. &lt;/strong&gt;You understand the operational dimensions of a product business—like sales, marketing, finance and legal—and know how to balance value with business constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization mindset. &lt;/strong&gt;Experience using rapid post-launch optimization techniques to refine live capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on product mastery.&lt;/strong&gt; A history of jumping into the front lines to demo tools, train users or handle support inquiries directly to build customer empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re always investing in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of your mental and physical health.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Medical plans tailored for you and your family—including vision, dental, and fertility benefits—and stay supported with our EAP and Employee Resource Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K)&lt;/strong&gt;. Yep, that’s free money. We’ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$93,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$155,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
