&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International compliance expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep working knowledge of employment law, payroll, benefits and compliance across multiple countries, with strong experience in European regions like the U.K., Spain, Italy and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience leveraging AI tools to optimize operations and improve workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
