&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring an &lt;strong&gt;Engineer II&lt;/strong&gt; to join one of our cross-functional product teams in our Athlete Performance group, which is focused on building cutting-edge solutions for athletes and sports teams that directly impact how they train, compete and achieve peak performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll focus on building high-performance mobile applications and core data services across iOS and Android. You will help build and maintain hardware-agnostic communication interfaces to stream live sensor and optical tracking data to the cloud and mobile clients. You&#39;ll work on translating complex physical and biomechanical data into clear, digestible metrics that support real-time decision-making for elite coaches, athletes, and medical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with a cross-functional team.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll collaborate with Engineering, Quality Assurance, Product, Design and Scrum disciplines to deliver feature-rich mobile and the back-end services that power them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and deliver.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll take ownership of specific features, defining low-latency communication interfaces across the stack and building user-facing application features that turn complex sensor data into clear, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test new ideas.&lt;/strong&gt; At Hudl, we iterate rapidly, deploying changes to the product hundreds of times daily across our Engineering team. You&#39;ll write high-quality code, conduct code reviews, and help solve well-defined technical problems using modern mobile and cloud development best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your skills.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll collaborate with senior engineers and tech leads to refine your technical architecture skills, learning to navigate trade-offs in system performance, real-time data streaming, and application responsiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience developing native or cross-platform mobile applications, ideally with React Native (iOS and Android).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience working with different API styles, communication patterns for streaming data across mobile clients and back-end systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team player.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that problem-solving is a team effort and enjoy collaborating with peers to learn, share knowledge, and build great software together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-focused.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re excited to build intuitive interfaces that translate complex physical or optical sensor data into digestible information for real-world users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Willingness to learn.&lt;/strong&gt; You have solid core engineering skills and are excited to dive into mobile frameworks, time-series data streams, or cloud architecture as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend &amp;amp; Cloud Architecture knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with modern cloud infrastructure (AWS/GCP), microservice architectures, time-series databases, and CI/CD deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Data Streaming experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Background working with real-time video, wearable devices, or streaming optical/sensor data, ideally within sports technology or performance analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile CI/CD.&lt;/strong&gt;Experience with mobile build and release pipelines (GitHub Actions), distribution platforms (TestFlight, Firebase App Distribution), and testing frameworks such as Jest and Detox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
