&lt;td style=&quot;height: 179.184px;&quot;&gt;Account Executives&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height: 179.184px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Executives&amp;nbsp;support market development of net new or acquisition revenue:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll collaborate with athletic directors and coaches to ensure their schools and teams have what they need to develop and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close sales on the phone and through online demos&lt;/strong&gt;. We believe the more calls and demos you make, the more sales you make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Knowledgeable about sports&lt;/strong&gt;. Being an athlete, coach or administrator in club or high school sports isn&#39;t necessary but would help you connect with our user base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Account Managers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Managers support market development and expand current accounts:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a sales cycle.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll collaborate with athletic directors and coaches to ensure their schools and teams have what they need to develop and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close sales face-to-face with customers in your territory.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe being face-to-face with customers is a key differentiator for success. You will also utilize phone and online demos to continuously drive sales forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across multiple sports.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Whether it&#39;s volleyball or American football, you&#39;ll understand how all programs can benefit from video analysis. Understanding our customer personas regardless of sport is extremely important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 257.587px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height: 257.587px;&quot;&gt;Customer Success Managers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height: 257.587px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Success Manager, you will focus on retaining and renewing business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engaging current users&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll help us ensure Hudl renewal rates are high and our customers remain engaged by conducting check-in calls with coaches and athletic directors. You&#39;ll provide education material and answer any questions they have.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Selling the value of Hudl&lt;/strong&gt;. Across your accounts, you&#39;ll continuously communicate with users to ensure they&#39;re getting the most of their Hudl products. You&#39;ll help identify where they could benefit from other products or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digging into dissatisfaction&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll get to the bottom of user issues and work hard to keep them with Hudl.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focusing on numbers&lt;/strong&gt;. Keeping renewal and engagement rates high, and cancellation rates low, will be your first priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 47.5868px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height: 47.5868px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business Development Representatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;height: 47.5868px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Business Development Representative, you will drive outbound communication and sales opportunities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate momentum and revenue&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;ll cold call, email and demonstrate products over Zoom to connect potential customers with the right Hudl solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Account Executives.&lt;/strong&gt; BDRs partner closely with Account Executives (who focus on growing acquisition revenue) to strategize on deal negotiations, maximizing revenue and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concentrate on a specific market.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll focus on our emerging markets which includes club and youth customers in North America across soccer, youth football, basketball, ice hockey and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
